OL,3,GNEWSATruckloads of debris wash ashore
OL,4,Afrom fishing boat that smashed onto
OL,5,Arocks
OL,6,
OL,7,FVolunteers have been collecting
OL,8,Ftruckloads of debris washed ashore from
OL,9,Fa fishing boat which ran aground and
OL,10,Fdramatically smashed apart off the west
OL,11,Fcoast of Orkney.
OL,13,FThe Genesis fishing boat struck rocks
OL,14,Foff the west coast of the island of Hoy
OL,15,Fon 1 October. All seventeen members of
OL,16,Fits crew were airlifted to safety.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
